## Deliverable

A reusable repo-ecosystem readiness contract for adopting future model/provider releases safely, including checklist dimensions, smoke/eval tasks, and an upgrade playbook.

---

## Pseudocode

```
inventory current provider-sensitive workflow surfaces: adapters, prompts, session logs, reviews, handoffs, tool semantics
group failure modes into repo-owned vs provider-owned drift
define readiness dimensions and checklist criteria for each repo and the overall ecosystem
design a compact golden-task battery covering planning, adversarial review, repo navigation, code-change discipline, and handoff integrity
outline upgrade workflow: detect release, run eval battery, classify failures, patch repo-owned surfaces, document provider-specific exceptions
produce report with contract, gap analysis, and prioritized follow-up issue candidates
```

